{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1686.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"02d97fafc2f1e7c01c828cf193c113c92ad701ed5b78a4e68a04c10916a544c4","ja":"罰ゲームの内容は？","zh":"惩罚游戏的内容是？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1686.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"8d96e30bc3db14042c6567f3fe060361ec2406c80e9f346c13f5a2429d94c0a9","ja":"「みなさん、お疲れさまでした！\n残念ながら最下位は…………響・エレナチームです！」","zh":"“各位，辛苦了！\n很遗憾，最后一名是…………响·艾莲娜队！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1686.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"fcc4da6726dd4bade671402f1e93dddd67a2339cce12f9de2113f0af4925a04d","ja":"うぎゃーっ！\n結局、逆転できなかったぞ～！！","zh":"哇啊——！\n结果还是没能逆转啊～！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1686.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"6decfee324e7b25ed47c19326c35f1201dde204959c3929994a53bb004e8e7ec","ja":"それじゃあ今から……\nワタシたち、罰ゲームするノ！？","zh":"那么现在开始……\n我们要接受惩罚游戏吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1686.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f15eb649991553da5c9a1cf58300680b94559f4fadb0a1688b4b9f78c4e5a155","ja":"「はい。覚悟してくださいね！\n罰ゲームは……」","zh":"「好的。请做好心理准备哦！\n惩罚游戏是……」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1686.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"044ac5ea9a44c0d96d45fb9cd5babb95328be9cf0e5aebd0722db05b44a945cb","ja":"（うう……どうしよ～、どうしよ～！）","zh":"（呜呜……怎么办～，怎么办～！）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1686.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1c645bca5dd19797d9ca1e771dd1327b49305d77f41243ec3fdd47aa2c7bdaa3","ja":"（怖いヨ～！　怖いヨ～！\nママン、パパン～！）","zh":"（好害怕唷～！好害怕唷～！\n妈妈、爸爸～！）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1686.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"0f707653025f868f255db5a44d09713faa1384f88e4335db7ff28d3a7ff4740d","ja":"「お互いの足の裏を、\n5分間くすぐりあっていただきます！」","zh":"“请互相挠对方的脚底板，\n持续5分钟！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1686.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"53599f977b9f5d0936b43b5d46960fd87c964076650b2069b58841986fbcb978","ja":"……へ？\nそ、そんなのでいいの！？","zh":"……诶？\n那、那样就可以了吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1686.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"c2f209d960a4bbabff36e9ebfaba59b1e5472764665f316948abb451b926c8b4","ja":"……アハハ♪　なんだ～！\n心配してソンしちゃったヨ～！","zh":"……啊哈哈♪　什么嘛～！\n害我白担心一场啦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1686.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"d33d439d50cb410aecc8fc530ad4ce26500e879afd11f912a4eec5e7e5c5959b","ja":"「おや？　余裕ですね～。それでは、どうぞ！」","zh":"“哎呀？挺从容的嘛～。那么，请吧！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1686.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"87ea9da49c59f856ef8c95122dd5a154b677b161ca627c21cb8f1c52566d9719","ja":"じゃあヒビキ！　全力でいくヨ～……。\nコチョコチョコチョコチョ……♪","zh":"那响！我要全力以赴咯～……。\n挠痒痒挠痒痒挠痒痒……♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1686.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"4f29e4860003454083968c41ed287c5af3fc5ad49b22e0fcea4433081d42625f","ja":"あはははははっ！\nや、やめて！　く、くすぐった……！","zh":"啊哈哈哈哈哈！\n别、别闹了！好、好痒……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1686.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"4b48e0aea0d6c0b08377e07d25c7d22cb433d74396777d9f2a1d9fe825b952fa","ja":"お返しだぞ～！\nコチョコチョコチョコチョ……♪","zh":"看我的回击～！\n咯吱咯吱咯吱咯吱……♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1686.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"49db4cc17c825edd04587ef76bb0868c519d9febaef9938731a0ae5146ec4abc","ja":"アハッ、アハハハハハッ！　わ、笑いすぎて、\nお、お腹、苦しい……アハハハハハッ！","zh":"啊哈哈，啊哈哈哈哈哈哈！笑、笑得太厉害了，\n肚、肚子好痛……啊哈哈哈哈哈哈！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1686.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"f701363775436a14262c4ac06c139705ba4d0531551a217dd0a0b5a9f8845c64","ja":"こ、怖い罰ゲームじゃなくてよかったけど……。\nじ、自分も、お腹が……あはははははっ！","zh":"虽、虽然幸好不是吓人的惩罚游戏……\n但、但我自己的肚子也……啊哈哈哈哈哈！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
